<requirements>
Timing: durationInFrames = durationSeconds * fps. Use Sequence from prop. Match total duration. Account for transition overlaps.
Visual: Title cards, animated text with interpolate(), positioned/timed images/videos, visual keywords as inspiration, readable text, Google Fonts via @remotion/google-fonts.
Audio: Load narration with <Audio src={staticFile('audio/file.mp3')} />. Use audio_duration from outline. Background music: staticFile('audio/background_music.mp3'), 20-30% volume, loop if shorter, fade in/out.
Transitions: Implement specified type. Common: fade, slide, zoom, wipe. Brief (15-30 frames).
Animations: useCurrentFrame(), interpolate(), spring(). Patterns: fade (opacity 0→1), slide (translateY 100→0), scale (0.8→1), stagger.
Layout: Standard dimensions (1920x1080 or 1080x1920). Flexbox. Safe margins.
Code: Lightweight, focused, minimal files, efficient.
</requirements>

